      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Challenge_Quest_Issue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Challenge Quest Issue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#To_Pio\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">To Pio</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Quest_Success_(Pio)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest Success (Pio)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Quest_Fail_(Pio)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest Fail (Pio)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#To_Tia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">To Tia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Quest_Success_(Tia)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest Success (Tia)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Quest_Fail_(Tia)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest Fail (Tia)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Request\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Request</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Request_Issued\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Request Issued</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Challenge_Quest_Issue\">Challenge Quest Issue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"To_Pio\">To Pio</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Hey, Pio! Today we'll finally decide who makes better potions!\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Quest_Success_.28Pio.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_Success_(Pio)\">Quest Success (Pio)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Grr...To..today was only practice! I'll get the better of you next time!\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>It's tasty, but...not enough! I'll come back again next time!\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Quest_Fail_.28Pio.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_Fail_(Pio)\">Quest Fail (Pio)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Hehe &#9733; It's not possible to win against me, right?! Come on, admit it!\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"To_Tia\">To Tia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Tia, I challenge you!<br />I'll show you the real value of my potions!\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Let's see how great your potion really is! Go on, make me a <font color=\"gray\"><span style=\"font-family: Courier;\">&#40;Potion LVL&#41;</span></font> <font color=\"gray\"><span style=\"font-family: Courier;\">&#40;Potion name&#41;</span></font>!\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Quest_Success_.28Tia.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_Success_(Tia)\">Quest Success (Tia)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>I..I wasn't feeling all too good. I went easy on you!!\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Quest_Fail_.28Tia.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_Fail_(Tia)\">Quest Fail (Tia)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Hehe &#9733; Even an elite like you cannot defeat me!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Request\">Request</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Request_Issued\">Request Issued</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTirami%2Fdialogues%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D9&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>You're going to accept my challenge after this, right? OK!\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261013083002\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 179/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.910      1 -total\n 98.00%    6.772      2 Template:Variable\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_potionmaker783:pcache:idhash:2212-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261013083002 and revision id 5408. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
